  "notes": "Skyworth 7S60_A5 (board 6A658B, sky8S34), China market, Coocaa OS on Android 8.0 (API 26)\nBuild OPR5.170623.014 / 022.008.220, armeabi-v7a, about 1.9 GB RAM.\nStock home: com.tianci.movieplatform (com.coocaa.homepage.vast.HomePageActivity; elder mode\ncom.ccos.cooui.movieplatform.ElderMainActivity). TV/inputs: com.skyworth.tv.\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/skyworth-7s60-a5/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/skyworth-7s60-a5/debloat.txt\nEverything is DISABLED, not uninstalled. Comment out any line you want to keep.\n\nDisabled before this debloat, so not listed (restore.sh would turn them ON):\ncom.bajintech.karaok, com.coocaa.activecenter.\n\nCoocaa OS has no Android HOME chooser and ignores set-home-activity: the launcher goes in through\na small homepage shim instead, see README.md in this folder. Tested in October 2026.\nAds and telemetry",
